    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TerraBlocks is a unique geography-based puzzle game that challenges you to rebuild the world, one piece at a time! This game puts your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills to the test as you fit drifting landmasses back into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continental pieces slowly slide down from the North Pole, and it's up to you to move, rotate, and drop them into their correct positions. As you progress, the difficulty increases, requiring precision and strategy to complete the Earth\u2019s puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Geography Meets Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Learn the true shapes, sizes, and positions of continents while playing.<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging Block-Dropping Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Move, rotate, and drop pieces to complete the puzzle. <br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Progressive Challenge</strong> \u2013 The more you place correctly, the faster and trickier the game becomes.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Improve Your Navigation Skills</strong> \u2013 Gain a deeper understanding of Earth's geography in a fun, interactive way.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Can You Reassemble the World?</strong> \u2013 Test your skills and see if you can complete the ultimate planetary puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to reshape the Earth? Play <strong>TerraBlocks</strong> today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TerraBlocks is a unique geography-based puzzle game that challenges you to rebuild the world, one piece at a time! This game puts your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills to the test as you fit drifting landmasses back into place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continental pieces slowly slide down from the North Pole, and it's up to you to move, rotate, and drop them into their correct positions. As you progress, the difficulty increases, requiring precision and strategy to complete the Earth\u2019s puzzle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Geography Meets Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Learn the true shapes, sizes, and positions of continents while playing.<br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Challenging Block-Dropping Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Move, rotate, and drop pieces to complete the puzzle. <br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Progressive Challenge</strong> \u2013 The more you place correctly, the faster and trickier the game becomes.<br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Improve Your Navigation Skills</strong> \u2013 Gain a deeper understanding of Earth's geography in a fun, interactive way.<br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Can You Reassemble the World?</strong> \u2013 Test your skills and see if you can complete the ultimate planetary puzzle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to reshape the Earth? Play <strong>TerraBlocks</strong> today!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
